B.Ps=new A.ci("Burning","assets/icons/kw_burning.png",B.cy,"In each assessment phase, this character loses 1 Health. While burning, they are a source of fire, all their attacks have the fire rule, and they cannot rest. Spend 2 consecutive actions to remove a burning counter.")
B.P9=new A.ci("Fatigued","assets/icons/kw_fatigued.png",B.cy,"A character can have any number of fatigued counters. When fatigued counters equal or exceed their actions, the character is stunned.")
B.Pa=new A.ci("Poisoned","assets/icons/kw_poisoned.png",B.cy,"In each assessment phase, roll the magic die. On 1\u20132 the character loses 1 Health. On 3\u20134 they lose 1 Skill peg (or Health if no skill pegs remain). On 5 they are fatigued. On 6 remove the counter.")
B.Pl=new A.ci("Stunned","assets/icons/kw_stunned.png",B.cy,"A stunned character cannot take actions, use skills, spend magic pegs, or voluntarily do anything, and will miss their next turn. On their turn, instead remove the stunned counter and mark them as activated.")
B.Pn=new A.ci("Terrified","assets/icons/kw_terrified.png",B.cy,"When a terrified character takes their turn, they spend all available actions moving as far as possible from enemies. They will not engage enemies but will run through hazards.")
B.Pb=new A.ci("Warded","assets/icons/kw_warded.png",B.cy,"The warded counter's value is its magical armour (forcefield), maintained in the assessment phase. If an unwarded character must increase their warded value, give them the appropriate counter.")
B.Pp=new A.ci("Wounded","assets/icons/kw_wounded.png",B.cy,"This character moves 1 square fewer. Also, in each assessment phase, roll the magic die. On 1\u20133 the character loses 1 Health.")
B.Pi=new A.ci("Cursed","assets/icons/kw_cursed.png",B.cy,"If this weapon rolls a critical hit, the target is cursed, even if no damage was caused.")
B.Pq=new A.ci("Armour","assets/icons/kw_armour.png",B.fX,"Physical armour reduces the number of hits suffered by the value shown each time the wearer is attacked.")
B.Pv=new A.ci("Unarmed Combat","assets/icons/kw_unarmed_combat.png",B.fX,"This value is found on a character's board. They may use this value to make melee attacks, even without a weapon.")
B.Pj=new A.ci("Fast","assets/icons/kw_fast.png",B.fX,"This character can move X additional squares when making a move action. If they have this ability from multiple sources, use the highest value.")
B.Pf=new A.ci("Terrifying","assets/icons/kw_terrifying.png",B.fX,"If this character rolls a critical hit when attacking, the target is terrified. If an enemy ends their turn within short range, roll the magic die \u2014 on a 1, that character becomes terrified.")
B.Po=new A.ci("Bludgeoning","assets/icons/kw_bludgeoning.png",B.dP,"If this attack rolls a critical hit, the target is fatigued, even if no damage was caused. The target suffers 1 additional fatigued counter for each damage caused. Rolls 1 extra die when attacking terrain.")
B.P4=new A.ci("Sharp","assets/icons/kw_sharp.png",B.dP,"If this weapon rolls a critical hit, the target is wounded, even if no damage was caused.")
B.Pt=new A.ci("Piercing","assets/icons/kw_piercing.png",B.dP,"Physical armour cannot negate hits from this weapon.")
B.P2=new A.ci("Entangling","assets/icons/kw_entangling.png",B.dP,"If this attack causes any hits, the target is fatigued. On a critical hit, the target is knocked prone. These effects apply even if no damage was caused.")
B.Pe=new A.ci("Blast","assets/icons/kw_blast.png",B.dP,"Blast attacks are aimed at a target square. If 2 or more hits are rolled, characters in the 8 adjacent squares also suffer the first attack that reaches them.")
B.Pg=new A.ci("Vicious","assets/icons/kw_vicious.png",B.dP,"Skull results on the blue die on attacks made with this weapon are critical hits.")
B.Pd=new A.ci("Quickstrike","assets/icons/kw_quickstrike.png",B.cz,"If this weapon rolls a critical hit during a melee attack, you may dash or make an attack with this (or any other weapon) for free after the initial attack resolves.")
B.P6=new A.ci("Cleave","assets/icons/kw_cleave.png",B.cz,"If this melee attack defeats an enemy, you may resolve the same attack against another eligible enemy, removing 1 hit. Continue as long as each hit defeats an enemy.")
B.P7=new A.ci("First Strike","assets/icons/kw_first_strike.png",B.cz,"When this character enters melee range of an enemy (including when placed or when a door opens), it gets an immediate free melee attack action.")
B.P5=new A.ci("Hawkeye","assets/icons/kw_hawkeye.png",B.cz,"This attack ignores partial cover and can fire at engaged characters at any range without randomisation.")
B.P3=new A.ci("Reach","assets/icons/kw_reach.png",B.cz,"You may make a melee attack against an enemy up to X squares away, including diagonally. Unless in contact, the characters are not considered engaged otherwise.")
